{"unit_id":"tupi00__dsh-step-fold#card-zh","repo":"tupi00/dsh-step-fold","commit":"52cba30e1d47c528d9bc1e38f4da60687adcc982","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"StepFold · 步骤折叠是一款面向 DSH Web 客户端的界面插件：它把每组过程步骤默认折叠为最近五步，并在步骤组底部提供展开全部的按钮；输入框上方还增加只回答、分步骤和无限制三个协作挡位。客户端通过样式和 DOM 观察更新折叠条，宿主端注册会话投影、提示词段、命令和工具守卫，挡位可按会话记录并由按钮或 /stepfold 命令切换。只回答模式拦截指定的写入、执行和协作工具，分步骤模式注入计划要求。适合希望缩短过程记录占用、控制助手协作方式的 DSH Web 用户。代码未要求额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:4-18","client.js:424-489","index.js:199-273"]}
{"unit_id":"tupi00__dsh-step-fold#card-en","repo":"tupi00/dsh-step-fold","commit":"52cba30e1d47c528d9bc1e38f4da60687adcc982","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"StepFold folds DSH Web process groups to the latest five steps, with a button to reveal all. Controls above the composer select Answer only, Step by step, or Unrestricted. The host stores each session’s mode and applies prompt rules and tool guards. No API key or external service is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:4-18","client.js:424-489","index.js:199-273"]}
