{"unit_id":"tupi00__dsh-step-fold#feature-1","repo":"tupi00/dsh-step-fold","commit":"52cba30e1d47c528d9bc1e38f4da60687adcc982","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"StepFold 的「过程步骤折叠」功能：每组默认只显示最近五步，较早步骤隐藏；组超过五步时底部出现按钮，可独立展开或收起该组。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:45-65","client.js:167-225"]}
